# Demo flow for the Craft Jobs API. Works in Visual Studio, Rider and VS Code (REST Client).
# Start everything first: docker compose up --build --scale worker=3
# The job version is the ETag: it starts at "1" and goes up by one with every change.
# Change the Idempotency-Key below to create another job.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create a job (201, ETag "1")
# @name createJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-job-0001

{
  "customerName": "Fjord Elektro AS",
  "siteAddress": "Storgata 1, 0155 Oslo",
  "description": "Rewire kitchen"
}

### 2. Retry the same request: same key and body, replays the first response (Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-job-0001

{
  "customerName": "Fjord Elektro AS",
  "siteAddress": "Storgata 1, 0155 Oslo",
  "description": "Rewire kitchen"
}

@jobId = {{createJob.response.body.$.id}}

### 3. Get the job (ETag "1")
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}

### 4. Edit the header (200, ETag "2")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{
  "description": "Rewire kitchen and replace the fuse box"
}

### 5. Same edit with the stale ETag "1": 412, nothing changes
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{
  "description": "This edit loses"
}

### 6. Add a labour line: job moves to InProgress (ETag "3")
# @name labourLine
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "2"

{
  "type": "Labour",
  "description": "Electrician hours",
  "quantity": 2.5,
  "unitPrice": 650.00
}

### 7. Add a material line (ETag "4")
# @name materialLine
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "3"

{
  "type": "Material",
  "description": "Cable 3x2.5 mm2",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unitPrice": 12.35
}

@labourLineId = {{labourLine.response.body.$.lines[0].id}}
@materialLineId = {{materialLine.response.body.$.lines[1].id}}

### 8. Correct the labour hours (ETag "5")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/lines/{{labourLineId}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "4"

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### 9. Delete the material line (ETag "6")
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/lines/{{materialLineId}}
If-Match: "5"

### 10. Complete the job: frozen, export queued in the same transaction (ETag "7")
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/complete
If-Match: "6"

### 11. Changing a completed job: 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/lines/{{labourLineId}}
If-Match: "7"

### 12. Watch the export: status goes Completed -> Exported, export.status Pending -> Succeeded
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}

### 13. List exported jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?status=Exported

### 14. Write without If-Match: 428
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "No precondition"
}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
